# Who reviews changes to the CI and deploy paths (#4915).
#
# This file only asks for the owner's review on a pull request that touches these paths. It does not block a merge:
# the ruleset does not require code-owner review, and the `owner-tap` label rule in scripts/merge_policy.py still
# decides what merges today. The last matching line wins, and every line names the same owner.
#
# Kept to CI and deploy files only (owner, 2026-11-22, #4915 round 3): once the ruleset requires code-owner review,
# every line here is an Approve he must give. scripts/tests/test_codeowners.py fails if a path the merge rules hold
# for the owner (scripts/lane_merge_rules.py OWNER_TAP_FILES and OWNER_TAP_PREFIXES) is left out.

# CI: workflows, this file, and the merge rules the merge-policy check runs.
/.github/                       @uncomposed
/scripts/lane_merge_rules.py    @uncomposed
# Keeps fork PRs off the self-hosted Macs.
/ops/runner-guard/              @uncomposed
# Deploys to the server.
/ops/server-deploy/             @uncomposed
/ops/*/deploy.sh                @uncomposed
/research/B4/deploy/            @uncomposed
# App Store and TestFlight upload settings.
/Config/ExportOptions-*.plist   @uncomposed
